individual choice budget
InquiryPayEquity
/
individual choice budget
Definition
Individual choice budget (Dutch: IKB) is used if the employer has an individual choice budget. It's elements are used for the different options an employee has regarding this budget as well as its costs.
Type
IndividualChoiceBudgetArrangement
https://ontology.setu.nl/inquiry-pay-equity#IndividualChoiceBudgetArrangement
